ost surreal forms of life i've  ever documented for the archive even the  most alien organisms in our oceans  aren't quite as surreal as what swims  below those waves if you've enjoyed  learning about the complex creatures of  polynices you can follow and support the  artist using the links in the  description an art book exploring more  about this amazing planet will be coming  sometime in the future so keep an eye  out  and as always thanks for watching if you  enjoyed this entry please lend your  support and like subscribe and hit the  notification icon to stay up to date on  all things curious see you in the next  video  you

